    },
    {
      "id": "tang-681",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "长沙过贾谊宅",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "刘长卿",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "三年谪宦此栖迟，万古惟留楚客悲。\n秋草独寻人去后，寒林空见日斜时。\n汉文有道恩犹薄，湘水无情吊岂知。\n寂寂江山摇落处，怜君何事到天涯。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "2ae350930be29641afa1fd82f8cb7f63d35560781e72bd08d1419d86f60627b3",
      "estimatedOutput": 734,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-681--2ae350930be29641afa1fd82f8cb7f63d35560781e72bd08d1419d86f60627b3.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-682",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "题扬州禅智寺",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "杜牧",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "雨过一蝉噪，飘萧松桂秋。\n青苔满阶砌，白鸟故迟留。\n暮霭生深树，斜阳下小楼。\n谁知竹西路，歌吹是扬州。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "9283eda66c26b6291ca6f7c7496b0d23a46e6a6666d40bbe9eb9ce54fbe0ea51",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-682--9283eda66c26b6291ca6f7c7496b0d23a46e6a6666d40bbe9eb9ce54fbe0ea51.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-683",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "望蓟门",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "祖咏",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "燕台一望客心惊，笳鼓喧喧汉将营。\n万里寒光生积雪，三边曙色动危旌。\n沙场烽火侵胡月，海畔云山拥蓟城。\n少小虽非投笔吏，论功还欲请长缨。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "f3aee06e0eef3af25e8a220ae9c115dcc720afa6a57263280891861f95372b63",
