      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-685--17d43b2f0c866665fc6069a62f95d08f3eb751e43045d3cdd70a20d469a92814.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-686",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "酬乐天频梦微之",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "元稹",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "山水万重书断绝，念君怜我梦相闻。\n我今因病魂颠倒，唯梦闲人不梦君。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "ce96864e2f00533e31beefd299b49c3ff0e50e7645180a6ed3aab072396da40c",
